    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_only" data-section-id="pg056_sec001" class="bg-white"><div class="w-full bg-purple-500"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-6 max-sm:gap-4"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-28 w-28 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-400 text-white shadow-md max-sm:h-20 max-sm:w-20"><div class="relative h-14 w-16 max-sm:h-10 max-sm:w-12"><div class="absolute left-0 top-3 h-9 w-9 rounded-full bg-white"></div><div class="absolute left-6 top-1 h-10 w-10 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white bg-transparent"></div><div class="absolute left-5 top-8 h-0 w-0 border-l-[10px] border-r-[2px] border-t-[12px] border-l-transparent border-r-transparent border-t-white"></div><div class="absolute left-11 top-9 h-0 w-0 border-l-[10px] border-r-[2px] border-t-[12px] border-l-transparent border-r-transparent border-t-white"></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><h1 class="adt-h1 font-bold text-white"><span data-id="pg056_n0002">Mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, vendime t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta</span></h1><h2 class="adt-h2 mt-3 border-b-4 border-purple-300 pb-2 text-black"><span data-id="pg056_n0003">Vendimmarrja dikur dhe sot</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-10 space-y-8"><h3 class="adt-h3 inline-block rounded-md bg-green-400 px-5 py-3 font-medium text-black shadow-sm"><span data-id="pg056_n0004">Situata 1.</span></h3><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-neutral-800"><span data-id="pg056_n0006">N&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Bledit kishin nisur nj&#xeb; diskutim interesant.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0007">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;tar&#xeb;t e familjes ishin p&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; t&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0008">- Ne duam q&#xeb; t&#xeb; d&#xeb;gjohet z&#xeb;ri yn&#xeb; n&#xeb; familje, - thoshte Bledi.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0009">- Edhe pse ne jemi f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;, duhet t&#xeb; na k&#xeb;rkohet mendimi p&#xeb;r vendimet q&#xeb; merren n&#xeb; familje.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0010">- Kan&#xeb; ndryshuar gj&#xeb;rat, - iu drejtua babai Bledit.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0011">- Ne ju kemi marr&#xeb; mendimin juve.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0012">P&#xeb;r shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra n&#xeb; familje, kemi vendosur s&#xeb; bashku.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0013">Kur un&#xeb; kam qen&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; si ti, - vazhdoi ai t&#xeb; fliste, - babai im nuk na pyeste fare, por vendoste vet&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjitha gj&#xeb;rat.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0014">Gjyshi yt, si kryefamiljar q&#xeb; ishte, i merrte t&#xeb; gjitha vendimet n&#xeb; familjen ton&#xeb;, por edhe gjyshi ndryshoi me kalimin e koh&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0015">Sot, ai ndihet shum&#xeb; i lumtur kur d&#xeb;gjon nipat dhe mbesat e tij teksa shprehin mendimet e tyre lirsh&#xeb;m.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0016">Bledi u habit nga fjal&#xeb;t e babait.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0017">Ai donte t&#xeb; dinte m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; rreth asaj q&#xeb; i tha babai.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0018">Biseda e tyre vazhdoi.</span> <span data-id="pg056_n0019">N&#xeb; fund, Bledi kuptoi se shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra kishin ndryshuar p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; nga e kaluara.</span></p><div class="border-l-4 border-purple-400 bg-purple-50 px-5 py-4"><p class="adt-body text-neutral-900"><span data-id="pg056_n0022">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e: vendimmarrje, dikur, sot, grup.</span></p></div></div></section></div>
